  "observations": [
    "index.html supplies an empty reactRoot and app.ts mounts AppWrapper with createRoot().render(), not hydrateRoot().",
    "AppWrapper renders routes through RoutesWrapper; pinned upstream wraps declarative legacy Router with CompatRouter; the committed patch and packed bridge replace the compat implementation with Router 7.18.4.",
    "Scenes builds fixed registered routes under host-shared react-router; query variables are query parameters and are not constructor names.",
    "SelectorShell consumes selected-run JSON, constructs URLSearchParams, and updates only four var-* values through locationService.partial. It does not feed serialized errors to a hydration API.",
    "No attacker-selected serialized SSR error producer was found on this bounded bootstrap/caller trace. This is not a universal assertion that Grafana or arbitrary third-party plugins cannot use data-router hydration.",
    "The acceptance probe deliberately enters createBrowserRouter error hydration on the actual shared host, with BioETLHarmlessProbe, constructor, __proto__ and TypeError. All four decoded as Error with no arbitrary constructor calls.",
    "Fix is the supplied 7.18.4 dependency/runtime, not an absence-of-exploit claim. The private bridge is not an official Grafana backport."
  ],
